    {\(\dfrac{\sqrt{5}-1}{4}\)}
    {\(\dfrac{\sqrt{5}-1}{2}\)}
    {\(\dfrac{\sqrt{5}+1}{4}\)}
    {\(\dfrac{\sqrt{5}+1}{2}\)}

